  "description": "One day, a child was abandoned at the home of a goblin born from a pair of beautiful flower-patterned shoes. The child was the son of a man who had spent the night with the goblin on the promise of marriage, only to run away afterward. Reluctantly, the goblin took the child in as a servant and named him “Bam.” Little did the goblin know that the child would one day harbor such deep affection for him...\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
